==Battleground==
*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*4 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Saber Alter (Enemy)|Saber Alter]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns.
**2 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**4 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**8 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Saber Alter is only at 15% here so her attacks are not very strong. Awakened Bahamut is able to kill it in one go even without protection from Octopus Cat. The other enemies are relatively weak so the most they will do besides provide money is soak up a few hits from your attackers.

